 design. Choose the model and colours; the echo is kept on target.<\/div><div>Free site survey, then a detailed quote within 1\u20133 days of the survey.<\/div><div>Installation by the PBC team, then the room is measured again for final tuning.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<section><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"eb\">Models & colours<\/div><h2>19 panel models, 10 bass traps, 12 colours<\/h2><p>From fabric panels and hexagons to timber slats and organic pebbles, in colours matched to your interior.<\/p><div class=\"models\"><div><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-kain.jpg\" alt=\"Fabric panel\" loading=\"lazy\">Fabric panel<\/div><div><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-hex.jpg\" alt=\"Hexagon\" loading=\"lazy\">Hexagon<\/div><div><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-slat.jpg\" alt=\"Timber slat\" loading=\"lazy\">Timber slat<\/div><\/div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20could%20I%20get%20your%20full%20acoustic%20panel%20catalogue%3F\">Request the full catalogue on WhatsApp<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section class=\"alt\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"eb\">Good to know<\/div><h2>Acoustic treatment is not soundproofing<\/h2><p>Acoustic panels make sound inside the room clear, but they don't stop sound getting in or out. If noise leaks to the neighbours or street noise comes in, the walls need soundproofing.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/music-studio-bali\/\">See PBC soundproofing \u2192<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section class=\"cta\"><div class=\"in\"><h2>Send us your room size<\/h2><p>We calculate the panel layout and send you a 3D design. Site survey and consultation are free.<\/p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20panels%20for%20my%20room.\">Chat on WhatsApp<\/a><\/div><\/s